i.MX93EVK/i.MX95-VERDIN-EVK/i.MX93-FRDM Board Support Package


Table of Contents
=================

1. Supported Boards
2. Change History
3. BSP Features
4. BSP Notes

1. Supported Boards
===================

This BSP supports the following boards:

   + MCIMX93-EVK: Board: MCIMX93-EVK SCH-51961 REV B5, 700-51961 REV B
		  CPU: i.MX93(52) rev1.1 1700 MHz
   + MCIMX93-FRDM: Board: MCIMX93-FRDM SCH-94611 REV B2, 700-94611 REV B
                  CPU: i.MX93(52) rev1.1 1700 MHz
   + MCIMX95-VERDIN-EVK: Board: MCIMX95-VERDIN-EVK V1.2A 35728087
		  CPU: i.MX95 rev1.1 at 1800MHz

2. Change History
=================

  - 2026/05 (LINUXPG-2941): Wind River Linux 10.26. Support MCIMX93-EVK board for both standard and preempt-rt
			    kernel based on NXP IMX SDK v6.18.
  - 2026/05 (LINUXPG-2941): Wind River Linux 10.26. Support MCIMX93-FRDM board for both standard and preempt-rt
                            kernel based on NXP IMX SDK v6.18.

3. BSP Features
===============

3.1 Supported Features
----------------------

The following BSP features are validated and supported.

  o Bus
	+ I2C: On-Chip I2C controller
	+ uSDHC: On-Chip ultra secured digital host controller

  o Network
	+ Ethernet: FEC 10/100/1000 MAC ethernet controller, Qualcomm AR8031 external PHY (iMX93 Only)
	+ Ethernet: DWMAC (iMX93-EVK and iMX93-FRDM)
	+ Ethernet: ENETC(iMX95 Only)
	+ FLEXCAN: Flexible controller area network

  o USB
	+ USB OTG Type C: On-Chip UTMI transceiver, high/full/low speed
	+ USB Host: xHCI compatible host controller in the chip

  o Storage
	+ eMMC: On-chip 32GB MTFC32GAKAEEF-AIT

  o Multimedia
	+ SAI Audio:
		+ WM8962 codec (iMX93-EVK Only)
		+ XCVR codec (iMX93-EVK and iMX93-FRDM)
		+ BT_SCO codec
		+ cs42448 codec (iMX93-EVK and iMX93-FRDM)
		+ wm8904 codec (iMX95 Only)
	+ HDMI: DSI to HDMI Adapter (iMX95 Only)
		LVDS to HDMI Adapter (iMX93-FRDM only)
	+ MIPI DSI Host Controller (iMX93-EVK Only):
		+ MIPI to HDMI
	+ LVDS LCD (iMX93-EVK Only)
		+ LVDS LCD: DY1212W-4856
	+ MIPI CSI Host Controller:
		+ RPI-CAM-MIPI AR0144 sensor (iMX93-EVK Only)
		+ os08a20 (iMX95 Only)
	+ GPU: PXP G2D (iMX93-EVK and iMX93-FRDM)
	+ NPU: Arm Ethos-U65 microNPU (iMX93-EVK and iMX93-FRDM)
	+ G2D: DPU (iMX95 Only)
	+ GPU: Mali-G310 (iMX95 Only)

  o Power Mgmt
	+ Suspend to RAM

  o Misc Devices
	+ UART: On-Chip High-Speed UART
	+ Watchdog: On-Chip H/W watchdog timer
	+ GPIO: On-Chip general purpose Input/Output
	+ RTC: On-Chip secure real time clock
	+ Thermal: Thermal Management Unit (TMU)
	+ EDMA: On-Chip Enhanced direct memory access controller
	+ EdgeLock Secure Enclave


4. BSP Notes
============

4.1 Target Notes
----------------

NOTE: This BSP is only validated in the following environment, if used in a
different environment it may run into unknown issues.

MCIMX93-EVK:
	 Processor:             IMX93
	 CPU Revision:          rev1.1
	 Board Revision:        MCIMX93-EVK SCH-51961 REV B5, 700-51961 REV B5
	 BootLoader:            U-Boot
	 BootLoader Version:    U-Boot 2024.04-lf_v2024.04+ge3219a5a734+p0 (Feb 18 2025 - 04:03:02 +0000)

MCIMX93-FRDM:
	Processor:             IMX93
	CPU Revision:          rev1.1
	Board Revision:        MCIMX93-FRDM SCH-94611 REV B2, 700-94611 REV B2
	BootLoader:            U-Boot
	BootLoader Version:    U-Boot 2025.04-g99518e6b6f20 (Feb 02 2026 - 05:52:54 +0000)

MCIMX95-VERDIN-EVK:
	Processor:             IMX95
	CPU Revision:          rev1.1
	Board Revision:        MCIMX95-VERDIN-EVK V1.2A 35728087
	BootLoader:            U-Boot
	BootLoader Version:    U-Boot 2024.04-lf_v2024.04+ge3219a5a734+p0 (Feb 18 2025 - 04:03:02 +0000)

4.2 Specify boot medium
-----------------------

4.2.3 MCIMX93-EVK (SCH-51961 REV B5, 700-51961 REV B5)
------------------------------------------------------

1. Booting from SD card

The following table shows the boot switch setup for SD2 boot

Switch  D1      D2      D3      D4
SW1301  OFF     ON      OFF     OFF

2. Booting from eMMC

The following table shows the boot switch settings to boot from eMMC MTFC16GAKAECN-2M.

Switch  D1      D2      D3      D4
SW1301  OFF     OFF     OFF     OFF

4.2.3 MCIMX95-VERDIN-EVK (V1.2A 35728087)

1. Booting from SD card

The following table shows the boot switch setup for SD2 boot

Switch  D1      D2      D3      D4
SW2     ON      OFF     ON      ON

2. Booting from eMMC

The following table shows the boot switch settings to boot from eMMC MTFC16GAKAECN-2M.

Switch  D1      D2      D3      D4
SW1301  ON      OFF     ON      OFF

